ll a flash of  electricity crackled Illuminating the  room as the plague doctor looked up to  greet the newcomers oh welcome may I  show you what I've been working on he  held up a long gleaming scalpel is that  it Maddie remarked unimpressed I I think  that's it Zach replied kind of boring  Janie's side if he could the project  doctor would have frowned I am but a  humble man of science doing my work if  that is not sufficient for you then I  apologize it's fine doc don't worry Dr  bright opened the next door follow me  and have your spines tingled by the next  terrifying chamber ew the group of teens  laughed still they had already spent  five dollars on this thing might as well  see it through and tell everyone at the  party later about this weird man and his  awful haunted house Dr bright LED the  group down a long narrow hallway it  smelled of rotten wood and mildew the  carpet squishing unpleasantly beneath  their feet keep an eye on your  surroundings Dr bright called over his  shoulder we might not be alone in here  behind him the kids rolled their eyes  just don't touch the walls Dr bright  said ominously the group followed him  not the least bit nervous it was a  creepy old house but there was nothing  in here scarier than a cockroach as  Janie felt something crunched beneath  her shoes she stopped to take a look ugh  she groaned when she looked up she  noticed something strange black goo  dripping down the wall next to her God  this place has  she grimaced her friends turned to see  what made her fall behind and their eyes  widened Janie Maddie's voice wavered  slightly Zach pointed behind you Janie  spun around and was confronted with a  horrific figure  scp-106 was emerging from the  desiccating wall smiling at her with a  wide toothless grin his flat eyes filled  with malice she gasped but then stopped  oh it's just an old guy that's fine nice  try Grandpa follow me please move away  from the wall please Dr Wright was  beginning to regret bringing scp-